    "body": "<section id=\"new-arrivals\" class=\"w3-new\" aria-labelledby=\"w3-title\">\n<style>\n.w3-new{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:var(--j2-section,64px) 16px}\n.w3-new h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,2.8rem);color:var(--j2-primary)}\n.w3-intro{margin:0 0 24px;max-width:38rem;color:var(--j2-muted)}\n.w3-grid{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}\n.w3-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;min-width:0}\n.w3-photo{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;background:var(--j2-surface);border:2px dashed var(--j2-muted);border-radius:var(--j2-radius)}\n.w3-tag{align-self:flex-start;margin:4px 0 0;padding:2px 10px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFFFF;background:var(--j2-secondary);border-radius:var(--j2-radius)}\n.w3-card h3{margin:0;font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--j2-text)}\n.w3-price{margin:0;font-family:var(--j2-font-heading);font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--j2-primary)}\n.w3-sizes{margin:0;color:var(--j2-muted);font-size:.95rem}\n.w3-link{margin-top:auto;border-radius:var(--j2-radius);text-align:center}\n@media (min-width:720px){\n.w3-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}\n}\n</style>\n\n<h2 id=\"w3-title\">New arrivals</h2>\n<p class=\"w3-intro\">Just in at Thread &amp; Loom. Pick your size and order from the collection.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"w3-grid\">\n  <li class=\"j2-card w3-card\">\n    <div class=\"w3-photo\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo spot for White chikankari kurta, photo not added yet\"></div>\n    <p class=\"w3-tag\">New</p>\n    <h3>White chikankari kurta</h3>\n    <p class=\"w3-price\">₹2,199</p>\n    <p class=\"w3-sizes\">Sizes: XS-XL</p>\n    <a class=\"j2-btn j2-btn-secondary w3-link\" href=\"#shop\">View in shop</a>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"j2-card w3-card\">\n    <div class=\"w3-photo\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo spot for Ikat handloom saree, photo not added yet\"></div>\n    <p class=\"w3-tag\">New</p>\n    <h3>Ikat handloom saree</h3>\n    <p class=\"w3-price\">₹3,999</p>\n    <p class=\"w3-sizes\">Free size</p>\n    <a class=\"j2-btn j2-btn-secondary w3-link\" href=\"#shop\">View in shop</a>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"j2-card w3-card\">\n    <div class=\"w3-photo\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo spot for Linen-blend shirt, photo not added yet\"></div>\n    <p class=\"w3-tag\">New</p>\n    <h3>Linen-blend shirt</h3>\n    <p class=\"w3-price\">₹1,599</p>\n    <p class=\"w3-sizes\">Sizes: M-XXL</p>\n    <a class=\"j2-btn j2-btn-secondary w3-link\" href=\"#shop\">View in shop</a>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n</section>",
    "workflow": "New arrivals"
  },
