    "body": "<section id=\"lookbook\" class=\"w4-look\" aria-labelledby=\"w4-title\">\n<style>\n.w4-look{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:var(--j2-section,64px) 16px}\n.w4-look h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,2.8rem);color:var(--j2-primary)}\n.w4-intro{margin:0 0 24px;max-width:38rem;color:var(--j2-muted)}\n.w4-grid{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}\n.w4-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;min-width:0}\n.w4-photo{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/5;background:var(--j2-surface);border:2px dashed var(--j2-muted);border-radius:var(--j2-radius)}\n.w4-num{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--j2-secondary)}\n.w4-card h3{margin:0;font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--j2-text)}\n.w4-items{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:6px}\n.w4-items li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding-bottom:6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--j2-surface)}\n.w4-item-name{min-width:0;color:var(--j2-text)}\n.w4-item-price{flex:none;font-weight:700;color:var(--j2-primary)}\n.w4-note{margin:0;color:var(--j2-muted);font-size:.95rem}\n.w4-link{margin-top:auto;border-radius:var(--j2-radius);text-align:center}\n@media (min-width:720px){\n.w4-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}\n}\n</style>\n\n<h2 id=\"w4-title\">Lookbook</h2>\n<p class=\"w4-intro\">Three outfit ideas put together from the Thread &amp; Loom collection. Photos will be added soon.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"w4-grid\">\n  <li class=\"j2-card w4-card\">\n    <div class=\"w4-photo\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo spot for outfit 1, photo not added yet\"></div>\n    <p class=\"w4-num\">Outfit 1</p>\n    <h3>Indigo and Ajrakh</h3>\n    <ul class=\"w4-items\">\n      <li><span class=\"w4-item-name\">Indigo block-print kurta</span><span class=\"w4-item-price\">₹1,499</span></li>\n      <li><span class=\"w4-item-name\">Ajrakh dupatta</span><span class=\"w4-item-price\">₹899</span></li>\n    </ul>\n    <p class=\"w4-note\">Kurta sizes S-XXL. Dupatta is free size.</p>\n    <a class=\"j2-btn j2-btn-secondary w4-link\" href=\"#shop\">Shop these pieces</a>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"j2-card w4-card\">\n    <div class=\"w4-photo\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo spot for outfit 2, photo not added yet\"></div>\n    <p class=\"w4-num\">Outfit 2</p>\n    <h3>Chikankari and Bandhani</h3>\n    <ul class=\"w4-items\">\n      <li><span class=\"w4-item-name\">White chikankari kurta</span><span class=\"w4-item-price\">₹2,199</span></li>\n      <li><span class=\"w4-item-name\">Bandhani dupatta</span><span class=\"w4-item-price\">₹1,099</span></li>\n    </ul>\n    <p class=\"w4-note\">Kurta sizes XS-XL. Dupatta is free size.</p>\n    <a class=\"j2-btn j2-btn-secondary w4-link\" href=\"#shop\">Shop these pieces</a>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"j2-card w4-card\">\n    <div class=\"w4-photo\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photo spot for outfit 3, photo not added yet\"></div>\n    <p class=\"w4-num\">Outfit 3</p>\n    <h3>The Ikat saree</h3>\n    <ul class=\"w4-items\">\n      <li><span class=\"w4-item-name\">Ikat handloom saree</span><span class=\"w4-item-price\">₹3,999</span></li>\n    </ul>\n    <p class=\"w4-note\">Free size. A new arrival.</p>\n    <a class=\"j2-btn j2-btn-secondary w4-link\" href=\"#shop\">Shop this piece</a>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n</section>",
