    "body": "<section id=\"size-guide\" class=\"w5-size\" aria-labelledby=\"w5-title\">\n<style>\n.w5-size{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:var(--j2-section,64px) 16px}\n.w5-size h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,2.8rem);color:var(--j2-primary)}\n.w5-intro{margin:0 0 24px;max-width:38rem;color:var(--j2-muted)}\n.w5-card{max-width:520px;padding:0;overflow:hidden}\n.w5-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:1rem}\n.w5-table caption{padding:16px 16px 8px;text-align:left;font-family:var(--j2-font-heading);font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--j2-text)}\n.w5-table th,.w5-table td{padding:12px 16px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--j2-surface)}\n.w5-table thead th{background:var(--j2-surface);color:var(--j2-secondary);font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.w5-table tbody th{font-weight:700;color:var(--j2-primary)}\n.w5-table tbody td{color:var(--j2-text);font-weight:600}\n.w5-table tbody tr:last-child th,.w5-table tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}\n.w5-note{margin:16px 0 0;max-width:38rem;color:var(--j2-muted);font-size:.95rem}\n.w5-link{margin-top:16px;border-radius:var(--j2-radius)}\n</style>\n\n<h2 id=\"w5-title\">Size guide</h2>\n<p class=\"w5-intro\">Chest measurements in inches for each size.</p>\n\n<div class=\"j2-card w5-card\">\n  <table class=\"w5-table\">\n    <caption>Chest size chart</caption>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th scope=\"col\">Size</th>\n        <th scope=\"col\">Chest (inches)</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><th scope=\"row\">XS</th><td>32</td></tr>\n      <tr><th scope=\"row\">S</th><td>34</td></tr>\n      <tr><th scope=\"row\">M</th><td>36</td></tr>\n      <tr><th scope=\"row\">L</th><td>38</td></tr>\n      <tr><th scope=\"row\">XL</th><td>40</td></tr>\n      <tr><th scope=\"row\">XXL</th><td>42</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"w5-note\">Sarees and dupattas are free size.</p>\n<a class=\"j2-btn j2-btn-secondary w5-link\" href=\"#shop\">Back to the shop</a>\n</section>",
