    "body": "<section id=\"store\" class=\"w6-store\" aria-labelledby=\"w6-title\">\n<style>\n.w6-store{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:var(--j2-section,64px) 16px}\n.w6-store h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,2.8rem);color:var(--j2-primary)}\n.w6-intro{margin:0 0 24px;max-width:38rem;color:var(--j2-muted)}\n.w6-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}\n.w6-card{min-width:0}\n.w6-card h3{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--j2-text)}\n.w6-list{margin:0;display:grid;gap:12px}\n.w6-row{display:grid;gap:2px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--j2-surface)}\n.w6-row:last-child{padding-bottom:0;border-bottom:0}\n.w6-row dt{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--j2-secondary)}\n.w6-row dd{margin:0;color:var(--j2-text);font-weight:600}\n.w6-row a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;min-width:44px;max-width:100%;color:var(--j2-primary);font-weight:700}\n.w6-hours{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:grid;gap:0}\n.w6-hours li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--j2-surface);color:var(--j2-text);font-weight:600}\n.w6-hours li:last-child{border-bottom:0}\n.w6-hours .w6-day{min-width:0}\n.w6-hours .w6-time{flex:none;text-align:right;color:var(--j2-primary);font-weight:700}\n.w6-closed{margin:16px 0 0;padding:12px 16px;background:var(--j2-surface);border-left:4px solid var(--j2-primary);border-radius:var(--j2-radius);color:var(--j2-text);font-weight:700}\n.w6-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:20px}\n.w6-btn{border-radius:var(--j2-radius);text-align:center}\n@media (min-width:720px){\n.w6-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n}\n</style>\n\n<h2 id=\"w6-title\">Visit us</h2>\n<p class=\"w6-intro\">Come see the collection at our shop in Pune. We are closed on Mondays.</p>\n\n<div class=\"w6-grid\">\n  <div class=\"j2-card w6-card\">\n    <h3>Find the shop</h3>\n    <dl class=\"w6-list\">\n      <div class=\"w6-row\">\n        <dt>Address</dt>\n        <dd>18 FC Road, Shivajinagar, Pune 411005</dd>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w6-row\">\n        <dt>Phone</dt>\n        <dd><a href=\"tel:+912040007788\">+91 20 4000 7788</a></dd>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w6-row\">\n        <dt>Instagram</dt>\n        <dd><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/threadandloom.pune\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">@threadandloom.pune</a></dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n    <div class=\"w6-actions\">\n      <a class=\"j2-btn w6-btn\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=18+FC+Road+Shivajinagar+Pune+411005\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get directions</a>\n      <a class=\"j2-btn j2-btn-secondary w6-btn\" href=\"tel:+912040007788\">Call the shop</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"j2-card w6-card\">\n    <h3>Store timings</h3>\n    <ul class=\"w6-hours\">\n      <li><span class=\"w6-day\">Tuesday to Sunday</span><span class=\"w6-time\">11am to 9pm</span></li>\n      <li><span class=\"w6-day\">Monday</span><span class=\"w6-time\">Closed</span></li>\n    </ul>\n    <p class=\"w6-closed\">The shop is closed on Monday.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "workflow": "Store links tap targets"
  },
