    "body": "<section id=\"orders-returns\" class=\"w7-orders\" aria-labelledby=\"w7-title\">\n<style>\n.w7-orders{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:var(--j2-section,64px) 16px}\n.w7-orders h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,2.8rem);color:var(--j2-primary)}\n.w7-intro{margin:0 0 24px;max-width:38rem;color:var(--j2-muted)}\n.w7-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}\n.w7-card{min-width:0}\n.w7-card h3{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--j2-text)}\n.w7-list{margin:0;display:grid;gap:12px}\n.w7-row{display:grid;gap:2px;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--j2-surface)}\n.w7-row:last-child{padding-bottom:0;border-bottom:0}\n.w7-row dt{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--j2-secondary)}\n.w7-row dd{margin:0;color:var(--j2-text);font-weight:600}\n.w7-note{margin:16px 0 0;padding:12px 16px;background:var(--j2-surface);border-left:4px solid var(--j2-primary);border-radius:var(--j2-radius);color:var(--j2-text);font-weight:700}\n.w7-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:20px}\n.w7-btn{border-radius:var(--j2-radius);text-align:center}\n@media (min-width:720px){\n.w7-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}\n}\n</style>\n\n<h2 id=\"w7-title\">Orders and returns</h2>\n<p class=\"w7-intro\">How to order, how delivery works, and our return and exchange policy.</p>\n\n<div class=\"w7-grid\">\n  <div class=\"j2-card w7-card\">\n    <h3>Ordering and delivery</h3>\n    <dl class=\"w7-list\">\n      <div class=\"w7-row\">\n        <dt>How to order</dt>\n        <dd>Order on WhatsApp at +91 98220 33445 with the product, size and quantity.</dd>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w7-row\">\n        <dt>Payment</dt>\n        <dd>Pay on delivery or UPI.</dd>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w7-row\">\n        <dt>Delivery</dt>\n        <dd>Delivery across Pune in 2 days.</dd>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w7-row\">\n        <dt>Delivery charge</dt>\n        <dd>₹79. Free above ₹2,999.</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n    <div class=\"w7-actions\">\n      <a class=\"j2-btn w7-btn\" href=\"https://wa.me/918822033445\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Order on WhatsApp</a>\n      <a class=\"j2-btn j2-btn-secondary w7-btn\" href=\"#shop\">Browse the shop</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"j2-card w7-card\">\n    <h3>Return and exchange</h3>\n    <dl class=\"w7-list\">\n      <div class=\"w7-row\">\n        <dt>Exchange</dt>\n        <dd>Exchange within 7 days if the item is unworn with tags.</dd>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"w7-row\">\n        <dt>Sale items</dt>\n        <dd>No returns on sale items.</dd>\n      </div>\n    </dl>\n    <p class=\"w7-note\">Exchange within 7 days if unworn with tags. No returns on sale items.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</section>",
    "workflow": "Ordering, delivery, returns and exchange"
  },
  "W-8": {
    "owner": "W-8",
    "head": "",
    "body": "<section id=\"reviews\" class=\"w8-reviews\" aria-labelledby=\"w8-title\">\n<style>\n.w8-reviews{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:var(--j2-section,64px) 16px}\n.w8-reviews h2{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,2.8rem);color:var(--j2-primary)}\n.w8-intro{margin:0 0 24px;max-width:38rem;color:var(--j2-muted)}\n.w8-grid{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}\n.w8-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-width:0;margin:0;border-top:4px solid var(--j2-accent)}\n.w8-quote{margin:0;font-family:var(--j2-font-heading);font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;color:var(--j2-text);overflow-wrap:break-word}\n.w8-name{margin:auto 0 0;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--j2-secondary)}\n.w8-link{margin-top:24px;border-radius:var(--j2-radius)}\n@media (min-width:720px){\n.w8-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}\n}\n</style>\n\n<h2 id=\"w8-title\">Customer reviews</h2>\n<p class=\"w8-intro\">What our customers say about Thread &amp; Loom.</p>\n\n<ul class=\"w8-grid\">\n  <li class=\"j2-card w8-card\">\n    <blockquote class=\"w8-quote\">&ldquo;Beautiful fabric, fits perfectly&rdquo;</blockquote>\n    <p class=\"w8-name\">Meera K.</p>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"j2-card w8-card\">\n    <blockquote class=\"w8-quote\">&ldquo;Fast delivery and lovely packing&rdquo;</blockquote>\n    <p class=\"w8-name\">Arjun S.</p>\n  </li>\n  <li class=\"j2-card w8-card\">\n    <blockquote class=\"w8-quote\">&ldquo;My go-to for festive kurtas&rdquo;</blockquote>\n    <p class=\"w8-name\">Priya D.</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<a class=\"j2-btn j2-btn-secondary w8-link\" href=\"#shop\">Browse the shop</a>\n</section>",
    "workflow": "Customer reviews"
  }
}